<title>USA: Nu-kote reaches deal for $145 mln credit.</title>
<headline>Nu-kote reaches deal for $145 mln credit.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nu-kote Holding Inc, which manages a portfolio of companies in the imaging supplies industry, said on Monday it agreed terms for a new $145 million credit facility with its bank group.</p>
<p>The agreement, which was subject to completion of final documentation, was expected to be signed on or about July 31.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859=1730))</p>
</text>
